# web-build's own stage (Dockerfile) runs `npm ci` and `npm run build`
# fresh inside the image — a host machine's own web/node_modules (which
# can carry platform-specific native bindings, e.g. Rollup's, built for
# the host's OS/arch rather than the image's) or a stale local web/dist
# must never leak into the build context, or `COPY web/ ./` after
# `npm ci` would silently overwrite what npm ci just installed/built.
web/node_modules
web/dist
